{"id":"e4f33cec5a88f9f1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-infinitary-rule.md","title":"Infinitary Rule","display":"df-infinitary-rule — Infinitary Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-infinitary-rule","aliases":["72-df-infinitary-rule"],"display":"df-infinitary-rule — Infinitary Rule","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; explicit countably branching scope","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-infinitary-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-infinitary-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-rule — Infinitary Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; explicit countably branching scope"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Q^\\omega\">\\(p\\in Q^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>。本地地址树接口只收有限或可数前提，故无限前提指标固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfRule}_\\omega(p;q):=\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\qquad\\operatorname{InfRuleSpace}_\\Sigma:=Q^\\omega\\times Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InfRule}_\\omega(p;q):=\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\qquad\\operatorname{InfRuleSpace}_\\Sigma:=Q^\\omega\\times Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义无限前提实例的编码；任意不可数指标的规则不属于此计数分支接口，需要另换地址树与指标对象。ω规则是本空间的具体子关系。</p>\n<p>2026-10-13 来源定位校正：语言及ω算术规则位于第III章印刷164–166/PDF176–178；本节点的通用编码／高度递归／有限一阶扩展仍为已标明的本地构造，并非原书所有参数化规则的逐字编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Q^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InfRule}_\\omega(p;q):=\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\qquad\\operatorname{InfRuleSpace}_\\Sigma:=Q^\\omega\\times Q.","display":true}],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-infinitary-rule|df-infinitary-rule — Infinitary Rule]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-infinitary-rule|df-infinitary-rule — Infinitary Rule]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-infinitary-rule|72-df-infinitary-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9"]}